@base = http://localhost:8012/reference/books
@bookId = replace-with-id-from-create-response

### Default service: SQLite
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"The Hobbit","author":"J. R. R. Tolkien"}

### Default list
GET {{base}}

### Read a book
GET {{base}}/{{bookId}}

### Qualified JSON service
POST {{base}}/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Dune","author":"Frank Herbert"}

### Qualified list; independent of SQLite
GET {{base}}/json

### list[BookService]: one result per implementation
GET {{base}}/backends

### Delete default-store book
DELETE {{base}}/{{bookId}}

### Missing ID: 404 error envelope
GET {{base}}/does-not-exist

### Validation: whitespace title returns 422
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"   ","author":"Someone"}
